OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fand bright evening but a few showers
OL,7,Fcontinuing over Argyll. A largely dry
OL,8,Fnight with clear spells but the odd
OL,9,Fshower will feed in from the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA lot of dry and bright
OL,12,Fweather and feeling quite warm. The
OL,13,Fodd light shower is possible.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,16,Fwith long sunny spells on Monday and
OL,17,Fbecoming a little warmer. Outbreaks of
OL,18,Frain spread north on Tuesday and
OL,19,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
